# .spellignore — words codespell should NOT flag.
# One lowercase word per line. Add Serbian words and domain-specific technical
# terms here when a legitimate word gets flagged as a typo.
#
# Serbian words that collide with codespell's English typo list:
nam
ne
te
som
fro
blok
tekst
autor
stil
metod
tabele
dokument
mane
implementator
proces
sistem
paket
analize
# 'theses' is a valid English plural of thesis; codespell over-flags it.
theses
# Technical / domain terms:
pandoc
crossref
bibtex
xelatex
latex
markdown
csl
odt
docx
librsvg
